{"title":"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Do there exist positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/0/720678bcd61d1beb1dac924a50f2c76a83e6a044.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3n^2+3n+7=m^3\\]\" width=\"147\" height=\"16\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba37f50c674bcbae995ed1d9dfd4beb5e53c765.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" /> can only be congruent to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46ba7755440400dac16456d523be94b359e6e6f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0, 1, -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> modulo 9.  So we can check the remainder when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/5/7f50691d59ae6e52a30cc08a4bbd326727e33eb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n^2 + 3n + 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" /> is divided by 9.  There are only nine cases to check, so we can do it manually.  To make computation easier, we can factor the left-hand side as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/3/3e301f05fbbab78dd09d80e6e0a7f38c23e8b827.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n(n+1)+7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />.  \n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/2/0020babbdc1c71dc39228f4ee74d41d1e5939d29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"81\" height=\"18\" />\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>5\n</td>\n<td>6\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/6/196fe328ad846910d4459af5bc8ade9254bea639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n(n+1)+7 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>7\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>There are no cases of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/d/f2d814a69503eb7c3bee27252be2bacf6f31bdac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n(n+1)+7 \\equiv -1 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"225\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/2/ea2e00975e019b39365729149e789bb8977c24b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3n(n+1)+7 \\equiv 1 \\pmod{9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"211\" height=\"18\" />, so there are no positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/5/6851ca945f78b10a85c14fc57fbaf75e69f57241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"34\" height=\"11\" /> that satisfies the original equation.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO\">2004 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017051942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 97/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 923/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 51/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2332/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   52.780      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%   52.780      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:18422:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017051942 and revision id 120043. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}